#: src/big_remote_play/ui/connection_guides.py:85
msgid ""
"Advanced alternative without a VPN. A domain only helps find the public "
"address; video travels directly between the computers, not through "
"Cloudflare’s web proxy. Nothing is configured automatically by this guide."
msgstr ""
"Avansert alternativ uten VPN. Et domene hjelper bare med å finne den "
"offentlige adressen; videoen sendes direkte mellom datamaskinene, ikke "
"gjennom Cloudflares nettproxy. Denne veiledningen konfigurerer ikke noe "
"automatisk."

